{"answer_text":"If nobody on the team wants to be the CRM admin, prioritise sensible defaults, guided import and few required fields. The easiest to get running:\n\n**Northwind CRM Essentials**\nPowerful and well supported, though per-seat costs climb quickly past the starter tier.\n\n**Pipewell**\nEasy to adopt, but email features cost extra.\n\n**Tallyfox Starter**\nBuilt for teams under 20, with email sequences on every plan and a setup most people finish in an afternoon.\n\nStart with Northwind CRM if you want the quickest setup; shortlist Pipewell if you expect to need deeper reporting.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50ad-7748-8729-7bf97880b11b","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.006,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:00:22.050Z","engine":"google_ai_mode","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["easiest crm to set up","crm without admin setup","simple crm onboarding time"],"latency_ms":13180,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a12333f09a","market_name":"United Kingdom","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[149,162],[467,480]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[267,275],[523,531]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a264dfde4e61","homonym":false,"is_subject":true,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Tallyfox","name_text":"Tallyfox","offsets":[[327,335]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"self","sentiment":"positive"